WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.271
The long winter ended.

2
00:00:05.272 --> 00:00:09.526
The bright sun made the riverbank green.

3
00:00:09.527 --> 00:00:13.099
The river flowed and sparkled again.

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.751
It was finally spring!

5
00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:20.470
Rat and Mole planned to go boating.

6
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:25.409
"But first, breakfast!" said Rat, as he ate his egg.

7
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.214
Mole finished his toast and jelly.

8
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:31.376
They heard a knock at Rat’s door.

9
00:00:31.377 --> 00:00:34.481
"Mole, I’m still eating," said Rat.

10
00:00:34.482 --> 00:00:36.787
"Will you answer the door?"

11
00:00:36.788 --> 00:00:40.580
"Sure," said Mole.

12
00:00:40.581 --> 00:00:46.297
Mole ran to the door and opened it.

13
00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:49.768
"Mr. Badger!" cried

14
00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:52.675
Mole. Rat dropped his

15
00:00:52.676 --> 00:00:55.584
fork. "Badger? Here?" said

16
00:00:55.585 --> 00:00:59.388
Rat. "He hardly ever leaves the Wild

17
00:00:59.389 --> 00:01:01.990
Wood!" Badger walked into the

18
00:01:01.991 --> 00:01:05.391
room. "The hour has come!" said Badger.

19
00:01:05.392 --> 00:01:07.961
Mole looked at the clock on the wall.

20
00:01:07.962 --> 00:01:10.834
"What hour?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:10.835 --> 00:01:14.479
"You should say whose hour!

22
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:19.079
It is the hour for Toad!" cried Badger.

23
00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:23.341
"What?" asked Rat, scratching his head.

24
00:01:23.342 --> 00:01:26.513
"Winter is over," said Badger.

25
00:01:26.514 --> 00:01:29.327
"We must take care of Toad!"

26
00:01:29.328 --> 00:01:32.721
"Hooray!" shouted Mole.

27
00:01:32.722 --> 00:01:35.490
He jumped up and down.

28
00:01:35.491 --> 00:01:37.175
"When?"

29
00:01:37.176 --> 00:01:39.924
"Right now!" said Badger.

30
00:01:39.925 --> 00:01:43.216
"Toad just bought another big car!"

31
00:01:43.217 --> 00:01:48.093
"Oh no," said Rat, getting up from the table.

32
00:01:48.094 --> 00:01:51.963
"We must get to Toad Hall," cried Mole.

33
00:01:51.964 --> 00:01:57.697
"Before it’s too late!" added Rat.

34
00:01:57.698 --> 00:02:01.518
The three friends rushed out the door.

35
00:02:01.519 --> 00:02:06.841
Together they set out for Toad Hall.

